"""
@title  Levered svZCHF -> crvUSD -> yvcrvUSD-2 carry loop, as a Yearn V3 strategy
@notice ZCHF in  -> svZCHF -> LlamaLend collateral -> borrow crvUSD @ target LTV -> Yearn vault
        ZCHF out <- unwrap svZCHF <- free collateral <- repay debt <- redeem Yearn vault
@dev    Self-contained ERC20 + ERC4626 over ZCHF. VaultV3.vy is the depositor and share
        holder, driving everything through IStrategy: asset(), maxDeposit(), report(),
        deposit(assets,receiver), redeem(shares,receiver,owner).
        Vault shares minted to us by the vault are NOT counted in totalAssets(); the vault
        already books that profit in strategy.current_debt.
"""

